{"ID":"20240206101554-7mqijn1","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206101554-7mqijn1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101554-7mqijn1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101604-wyvjshs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101557-uq22f28\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101604-wyvjshs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"木鳖子","type":"doc","updated":"20240830172517"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206101604-wyvjshs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101604-wyvjshs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广西、四川、湖北等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈扁平圆板状，中间稍隆起或微凹陷，直径2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4cm，厚约0.5cm。表面灰棕色至黑褐色，有网状花纹，在边缘较大的一个齿状突起上有浅黄色种脐。外种皮质硬而脆，内种皮灰绿色，绒毛样。子叶2，黄白色，富油性。有特殊的油腻气，味苦。\n【性味】\t苦、微甘，凉；有毒。\n【功效】\t散结消肿，攻毒疗疮。用于疮疡肿毒，乳痈，瘰疠，痔漏，干癣，秃疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240206101557-uq22f28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101557-uq22f28","updated":"20240206101557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206101557-co5pga8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715081625-6wtwgnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715081625-6wtwgnt","updated":"20240715081813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 381px;","style":"width: 371px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木鳖子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木鳖子-20240715081625-s93d8ul.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 371px;\" parent-style=\"width: 381px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 355px;","style":"width: 345px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木鳖子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木鳖子 1-20240715081812-gdglt2u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 345px;\" parent-style=\"width: 355px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715081333-70m5tei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715081333-70m5tei","updated":"20240715083000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 629px;","style":"width: 619px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木鳖子 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木鳖子 8-20240715082836-9q9wl5d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 619px;\" parent-style=\"width: 629px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 629px;","style":"width: 619px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木鳖子 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木鳖子 9-20240715083000-551iuyj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 619px;\" parent-style=\"width: 629px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715082007-eeq313p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715082007-eeq313p","updated":"20240715082048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeT